      "writtenOn": "2026-07-01T17:50:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The blob store is content-addressible, so the content for a given key should never change.  If it were somehow removed, we would not notice it, but that should never happen (because we don\u0027t remove blobs for secrets that are in use), and even if it did, it would be the same behavior as we got before we used the blob store for (some) secrets: the secret was still usable for the job that uses it.",
